{"id":"vod_md_7594","vodId":"7594","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20240228-1/05ced8c4bacc1b9d0a0461c952d85079.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《kiss×sis 亲亲姐姐》改编自日本漫画家ぢたま某的同名漫画作品，由feel.动画工作室制作，于2010年4月5日起在AT-X播放，全12话。\r\n住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-02-28 09:01:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/kuX9pnfa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/QSqXRBKo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/AcGohZIA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/TPzYGA8v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/aAIh71Po/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/P6zMpELo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/xPqRvmUd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/zSYmU1OU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/NhuXwGB0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/NcD2sTwO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/tgevtYiD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240226/t4ApnRko/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:20.269Z"}